WEBVTT

00:04:59.620 --> 00:05:01.400
How do we get this done?

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:07.656
The first city to adopt
the 15-minute city idea

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:09.086
is Paris,

00:05:09.110 --> 00:05:10.269
France.

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:16.536
Mayor Anne Hidalgo has suggested
a big bang of proximity,

00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:21.786
which includes, for instance,
a massive decentralization,

00:05:21.810 --> 00:05:24.787
developing new services
for each of the districts --

00:05:24.811 --> 00:05:26.682
(City sounds)

00:05:26.706 --> 00:05:32.005
a reduction of traffic by increasing
bike lanes into spaces of leisure;